So ReAct is not yet fully closed-loop in production.\
\
## Production multi-agent use case\
- **Best for**: dynamic retrieval/search-heavy tasks where agent must iteratively decide next step (research, support triage, incident investigation).\
- **In ThinkLife**: a \'93Research Agent\'94 could repeatedly query Tavily + vector DB until confidence is acceptable, then handoff final result to a \'93Care Response Agent.\'94\
