## 3) Pattern 2: Plan-and-Execute\
\
## What it is\
Two-phase architecture:\
1. create plan,\
2. execute plan deterministically.\
\
## ThinkLife implementation (already strong)\
\
```python\
# backend/brain/specs/workflow_specs.py\
execution_strategy: str = "direct"  # direct | reasoned | adaptive\
reasoning_threshold: float = 0.7\
```\
\
Source: `backend/brain/specs/workflow_specs.py:70`\
\
```python\
# backend/brain/cortex/cortex.py\
if strategy == "reasoned":\
    return await self._create_reasoned_plan(agent_specs, request)\
elif strategy == "adaptive":\
    return await self._create_adaptive_plan(agent_specs, request)\
```\
\
Source: `backend/brain/cortex/cortex.py:244`\
\
```python\
# backend/brain/cortex/cortex.py\
confidence = reasoning_result.get("confidence", 0.0)\
threshold = agent_specs.processing.reasoning_threshold\
if confidence >= threshold:\
    return ExecutionPlan(...optimized_specs=reasoning_result["optimized_specs"]...)\
else:\
    return ExecutionPlan(...optimized_specs=agent_specs...)\
